  "seoTitle": "Prabowo To Submit Vice Presidential Nominees",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto is expected to submit vice presidential nominees by November 25 as speculation grows regarding potential candidates.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo is set to propose two vice presidential candidates for the replacement of Gibran Rakabuming Raka by November 25.",
    "Prominent figures within the Gerindra party, including Sufmi Dasco Ahmad, Ahmad Muzani, and Sugiono, are currently identified as potential contenders.",
